@startuml state-happyhour
!include style.iuml
title State diagram - HappyHour (Stage 3, derived from activatedTurn)

state AVAILABLE
state ACTIVE STAGE3
state USED

AVAILABLE : canActivate() = true
AVAILABLE : prompt shown at every turn start
ACTIVE : orders: billFor(item) x 80%
ACTIVE : turn start / waiting customers +15 (max 100)
ACTIVE : describe() shows the turns remaining
USED : canActivate() = false, no prompt

[*] --> AVAILABLE : new HappyHour()\n/ activatedTurn = -1
AVAILABLE --> AVAILABLE : turn start\n[manager answers n]
AVAILABLE --> ACTIVE : activate(turn)\n[manager answers y]\n/ activatedTurn = turn
ACTIVE --> USED : next turn start\n[turn >= activatedTurn + 2]
USED --> [*] : game ends
@enduml
